WEBVTT

1
00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.026
I told you
girls to smile.

2
00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:41.217
[buzzer]

3
00:03:32.512 --> 00:03:34.537
[screams]

4
00:03:52.332 --> 00:03:54.357
[tires screech]

5
00:03:56.135 --> 00:03:58.365
[tires screech]

6
00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:26.156
[door opens and closes]

7
00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:52.591
Galia, they're
going to kill us.

8
00:04:52.659 --> 00:04:55.594
They'll kill us,
I know it. I don't
want to die.

9
00:04:55.662 --> 00:04:59.758
Don't show them
you're scared.

10
00:04:59.832 --> 00:05:01.993
They'll kill us
I don't want to die.

11
00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:04.832
Calm down.
Calm down.

12
00:05:04.904 --> 00:05:07.498
Wait. Wait!

13
00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:18.242
Where is it?.

14
00:05:20.386 --> 00:05:21.683
Where is it?.

15
00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:28.992
It's mine!
It's mine!

16
00:05:35.034 --> 00:05:37.628
Quiet! Quiet!

17
00:05:37.704 --> 00:05:39.399
[crying]

18
00:05:54.654 --> 00:05:56.417
No. No.

19
00:05:56.489 --> 00:05:57.820
[shouts]
No!

20
00:06:03.463 --> 00:06:05.055
Give it to me!
It's mine!

21
00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:15.102
Give it to me!
It's mine!

22
00:06:15.174 --> 00:06:17.642
[screams]

23
00:06:21.581 --> 00:06:23.742
[shouts]

24
00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:53.365
What do you
think you're doing?

25
00:07:55.341 --> 00:07:57.901
Is this the thanks
I get for all l
do for you?.

26
00:07:59.579 --> 00:08:01.444
Hm?

27
00:08:28.975 --> 00:08:31.205
Do you want
to end up
like Nina?.

28
00:08:32.945 --> 00:08:38.440
They buried her
in Rishon Beach, three
meters under the ground.

29
00:08:38.518 --> 00:08:41.214
They plan to do
the same to you.

30
00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:45.716
Are you not
listening to me?.

31
00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.827
Wash your damned face,
change your clothes,

32
00:08:50.897 --> 00:08:54.355
and go back
to the nest.
There's no time.

33
00:08:58.037 --> 00:09:01.029
Everything hurts.

34
00:09:01.107 --> 00:09:05.009
Galia, you're not
listening to me.

35
00:09:08.948 --> 00:09:11.109
I'm not going
back there.

36
00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:19.715
They'll burn
your body,

37
00:09:19.792 --> 00:09:23.387
and sweep the ashes away
till nothing's left.

38
00:09:26.766 --> 00:09:28.734
Let me go.

39
00:09:28.801 --> 00:09:32.430
Listen, bitch.

40
00:09:32.505 --> 00:09:36.942
Who the hell are
you to tell me what
you want or don't want?.

41
00:09:37.009 --> 00:09:40.843
Who the hell are you?.
You dirty whore!

42
00:09:40.913 --> 00:09:44.212
You abandoned
your child! You make
a living thanks to me!

43
00:09:44.283 --> 00:09:47.719
You bitch!
You're still alive
because I say so!

44
00:09:55.261 --> 00:09:57.388
You want
to leave?.

45
00:10:00.199 --> 00:10:03.532
Want me
to help you?.

46
00:10:05.237 --> 00:10:08.570
So help me, too.
Nothing in life
is free.

47
00:10:15.214 --> 00:10:18.206
Give it to me.

48
00:10:21.721 --> 00:10:24.554
Here, it's yours
from now on.

49
00:10:24.624 --> 00:10:29.084
Now you get out
of the car,
go there,

50
00:10:29.161 --> 00:10:32.756
put a bullet in
the guard's head,

51
00:10:32.832 --> 00:10:36.825
and two in that fat
guy. Is that clear?.

52
00:10:36.902 --> 00:10:41.430
You want to leave
the nest, right?. This
is the quick way out.

53
00:10:46.979 --> 00:10:48.708
You want me
to call the guys

54
00:10:48.781 --> 00:10:54.048
and tell them to go
to Dobrinensky 37,
apartment 6?.

55
00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:55.553
Is it apartment 6?.

56
00:10:55.621 --> 00:10:57.054
Third floor,
apartment 6.

57
00:10:57.123 --> 00:11:00.320
Is that what you want?.
It's not a problem.

58
00:11:00.393 --> 00:11:04.056
Look what
they sent me.

59
00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:08.362
Look what they
sent me...just now.

60
00:11:11.337 --> 00:11:14.431
All this technology,
it's unbelievable.

61
00:11:14.507 --> 00:11:17.704
Someone on the other
side of the world
takes a picture,

62
00:11:17.777 --> 00:11:21.577
and it's here
in a second.
Fantastic.

63
00:11:23.115 --> 00:11:26.380
Calm down.
Calm down!

64
00:11:28.654 --> 00:11:30.485
Save your strength.

65
00:11:30.556 --> 00:11:33.047
Relax. They
won't kill her.

66
00:11:33.125 --> 00:11:38.563
Are you crazy?.
We're not animals.

67
00:11:38.631 --> 00:11:41.122
It's a shame.

68
00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:43.896
She's so beautiful.

69
00:11:43.969 --> 00:11:46.062
They'll turn her into
what you've become.

70
00:11:46.138 --> 00:11:49.630
What a shame.
She'll go down
the same road as you.

71
00:11:49.709 --> 00:11:52.940
She'll pay for
what you've done,
if you don't do this.

72
00:11:53.012 --> 00:11:54.912
Is that what
you want?.

73
00:11:59.285 --> 00:12:00.877
Is it?.

74
00:12:07.693 --> 00:12:09.024
Is it?.

75
00:12:17.336 --> 00:12:20.669
I want my passport.
And my money.

76
00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:25.177
Oh, thank God.

77
00:12:25.244 --> 00:12:28.680
That's what
I wanted to hear.
You're a smart girl.

78
00:12:28.748 --> 00:12:32.275
That's why I like you.
You grasp things
so quickly!

79
00:12:32.351 --> 00:12:33.978
Passport and money!

80
00:12:34.053 --> 00:12:35.987
Shut up!
I'm not deaf!

81
00:12:36.055 --> 00:12:38.489
You'll get it. Do
what I asked you to.

82
00:12:38.557 --> 00:12:40.718
Go ahead,
before they leave.

83
00:15:13.913 --> 00:15:15.847
[people shouting]

84
00:17:00.719 --> 00:17:02.414
You like it?

85
00:17:28.547 --> 00:17:32.415
Go shopping,
find yourself
some decent clothes.

86
00:17:32.484 --> 00:17:35.385
And fix this place up.

87
00:17:35.454 --> 00:17:37.513
We'll talk later.

88
00:17:37.589 --> 00:17:42.288
Is this all?. Where's
the rest of the money
and my passport?.

89
00:17:54.173 --> 00:17:56.403
I'll be here at 8:.00.

90
00:18:46.592 --> 00:18:47.752
(little girl)
Hello?

91
00:18:49.128 --> 00:18:50.652
Who is this?

92
00:18:52.064 --> 00:18:55.522
(man)
Hello? Hello?
Who is this?

93
00:18:55.601 --> 00:18:58.468
It's me. Galia.

94
00:19:00.105 --> 00:19:03.268
How are you?.

95
00:19:03.342 --> 00:19:06.209
What do you want?

96
00:19:06.278 --> 00:19:10.146
T o talk.
Let me talk
to her, please.

97
00:19:14.486 --> 00:19:16.954
I'm coming home.

98
00:19:17.022 --> 00:19:19.013
What for?

99
00:19:19.091 --> 00:19:21.559
I want to see her.

100
00:19:22.794 --> 00:19:25.262
Don't come back.

101
00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:28.595
I told her
you are dead.

102
00:19:28.667 --> 00:19:30.430
(little girl)
Daddy?

103
00:19:30.502 --> 00:19:33.767
Daddy, what are we
having for lunch?

104
00:19:33.839 --> 00:19:37.400
Lena, be quiet.
I'm on the phone.

105
00:19:38.544 --> 00:19:42.537
Please. Let me
speak with her.

106
00:19:42.614 --> 00:19:46.380
[phone off the hook]

107
00:21:03.161 --> 00:21:06.426
[man and woman arguing]

108
00:21:08.567 --> 00:21:11.297
[glass smashes]

109
00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:14.965
[arguing continues]

110
00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:15.397
[man arguing]

111
00:22:41.727 --> 00:22:44.560
[slap, woman cries]

112
00:22:51.770 --> 00:22:53.795
(Mishka)
You're my
best worker.

113
00:22:55.874 --> 00:22:57.603
This is my last job.

114
00:22:59.044 --> 00:23:02.241
And if l
say it's not?.

115
00:23:02.314 --> 00:23:04.612
But you promised.

116
00:23:04.683 --> 00:23:09.814
I thought we'd
celebrate properly,
with Humus and Vodka.

117
00:23:09.888 --> 00:23:12.448
But you have
no patience.

118
00:23:13.658 --> 00:23:16.491
T ake it.

119
00:23:16.561 --> 00:23:19.189
In two weeks.

120
00:23:19.264 --> 00:23:22.859
It's not first class,
but it's a window seat.

121
00:23:24.069 --> 00:23:25.832
Where's the rest
of the money?.

122
00:23:25.904 --> 00:23:30.136
Do your job now. Come back
in two days to get your
money and passport.

123
00:23:31.843 --> 00:23:35.438
I'm sick of
your sour face.

124
00:23:35.514 --> 00:23:38.506
I won't miss
yours, either.

125
00:23:41.453 --> 00:23:43.717
Aerosvit 238.

126
00:23:43.789 --> 00:23:46.155
T el Aviv-Kiev.

127
00:23:49.294 --> 00:23:52.661
[man and woman arguing]

128
00:23:58.270 --> 00:24:03.003
[muffled pop music]

129
00:24:13.585 --> 00:24:17.043
[banging, man shouting]

130
00:24:35.073 --> 00:24:37.405
M usic very loud.

131
00:24:49.454 --> 00:24:51.422
T urn off music, please.

132
00:24:52.657 --> 00:24:54.557
T urn off music now
or I call police.

133
00:25:06.872 --> 00:25:08.897
Get inside already!

134
00:25:56.454 --> 00:25:58.422
Stop following me!

135
00:26:06.631 --> 00:26:08.121
Leave me alone!

136
00:26:08.199 --> 00:26:10.167
I don't need
your help.

137
00:26:16.608 --> 00:26:18.303
It's 19.90 NlS.

138
00:26:18.376 --> 00:26:19.866
Here.

139
00:26:22.480 --> 00:26:24.277
Thanks.

140
00:26:36.061 --> 00:26:37.961
It's 85 NlS.

141
00:27:11.830 --> 00:27:13.661
I owe you
bottle of water.

142
00:27:15.233 --> 00:27:17.098
Also tissue.

143
00:27:17.168 --> 00:27:19.466
What?.

144
00:27:30.982 --> 00:27:35.783
I don't have tissue,
but I have toilet
paper, extra soft.

145
00:27:37.055 --> 00:27:39.615
It's closest I found.

146
00:27:43.995 --> 00:27:45.986
You cooking something?.

147
00:27:58.076 --> 00:27:59.566
It's good,
these noodles.

148
00:28:01.079 --> 00:28:03.707
I like this, too.

149
00:28:03.782 --> 00:28:08.742
Just that you have
to know how to, um,

150
00:28:08.820 --> 00:28:13.780
toss it, how to
jump it, you know.

151
00:28:13.858 --> 00:28:15.758
And make
the sauce good.

152
00:28:15.827 --> 00:28:17.818
I follow instructions.

153
00:28:17.896 --> 00:28:20.956
Yes, but with this kind,
instructions no good.

154
00:28:22.434 --> 00:28:24.766
Here instructions
in Russian.

155
00:28:27.539 --> 00:28:29.632
He's gonna
be back soon.

156
00:28:33.845 --> 00:28:38.111
If I'm not home,
he gets angry, you know.
If he knows I'm here--

157
00:28:38.183 --> 00:28:39.514
So go.

158
00:28:52.530 --> 00:28:54.327
This you paint?.

159
00:28:59.404 --> 00:29:02.202
Looks like Eilat.

160
00:29:02.273 --> 00:29:03.900
Eilat?.

161
00:29:03.975 --> 00:29:05.704
Yes.

162
00:29:05.777 --> 00:29:08.337
It's a city
in the South.

163
00:29:08.413 --> 00:29:10.040
Nice place.

164
00:29:14.786 --> 00:29:16.219
Listen.

165
00:29:18.189 --> 00:29:20.054
My husband, he--

166
00:29:21.426 --> 00:29:24.793
He's not always
like this, you know.

167
00:29:24.863 --> 00:29:27.263
Sometimes he gets--

168
00:29:29.167 --> 00:29:30.634
You know.

169
00:29:30.702 --> 00:29:32.363
Yes, I know.

170
00:29:34.672 --> 00:29:37.368
Sometimes he don't
like your food,

171
00:29:37.442 --> 00:29:40.036
sometimes he has
a bad day at work,

172
00:29:40.111 --> 00:29:44.639
sometimes too much money
to pay for bills, sometimes
weather no good.

173
00:29:44.716 --> 00:29:46.684
Yes, I know.

174
00:29:52.190 --> 00:29:53.657
So, we okay?.

175
00:29:55.126 --> 00:29:57.060
It's not your fault.

176
00:30:09.574 --> 00:30:11.940
Are you long
time in lsrael?.

177
00:30:15.413 --> 00:30:17.040
Two.

178
00:30:17.115 --> 00:30:20.084
Really?. You
speak Hebrew?.

179
00:30:21.719 --> 00:30:23.118
A little.

180
00:30:24.956 --> 00:30:26.321
What's up?.

181
00:30:26.391 --> 00:30:28.916
Goddamn it.

182
00:30:28.993 --> 00:30:30.221
Go fuck yourself.

183
00:30:30.295 --> 00:30:32.456
Nice!

184
00:30:35.166 --> 00:30:37.600
[telephone rings]

185
00:31:02.794 --> 00:31:06.890
I'm probably
disturbing you.

186
00:31:06.965 --> 00:31:10.264
You're busy
with this cooking
and everything, so.

187
00:31:10.335 --> 00:31:11.461
I should go.

188
00:31:11.536 --> 00:31:14.369
You can take.

189
00:31:14.439 --> 00:31:17.704
What?. No, forget it.
No. I can't. I have--

190
00:31:17.775 --> 00:31:19.402
It's not nice,
you don't know me.

191
00:31:19.477 --> 00:31:21.945
No, take it.

192
00:31:29.354 --> 00:31:32.755
[telephone rings]

193
00:31:46.604 --> 00:31:50.540
That one is
better. This one
is nothing special.

194
00:31:52.710 --> 00:31:55.804
This one, yes.
This is on mivtza.
You know, on sale?.

195
00:31:55.880 --> 00:31:58.474
You take one,
you get one free.
You know?.

196
00:31:58.549 --> 00:32:02.815
This one,
the one you take,
no mivtza. Okay?.

197
00:32:02.887 --> 00:32:06.618
If you already
eat this shit, at
least don't pay extra.

198
00:32:09.560 --> 00:32:12.051
Much better
with mivtza. Come.

199
00:32:13.331 --> 00:32:15.060
Where did you
take this from?.

200
00:32:17.702 --> 00:32:21.900
You never, never
take milk from
first row. Never.

201
00:32:21.973 --> 00:32:24.032
Always from
the back.

202
00:32:26.377 --> 00:32:29.744
See?. Much better date.

203
00:32:29.814 --> 00:32:32.715
Two years you're here,
and you don't know this?.

204
00:32:32.784 --> 00:32:35.878
Come, I'll put you
in express line.

205
00:32:35.954 --> 00:32:39.219
Excuse me,
pardon me.

206
00:32:39.290 --> 00:32:40.689
What's going on?.

207
00:32:40.758 --> 00:32:42.817
Nothing's going on,
everything is okay.

208
00:32:42.894 --> 00:32:48.696
I work here, people. Relax,
breathe. Everything's okay.

209
00:32:50.201 --> 00:32:53.693
Put 54 NlS on my tab.
Okay, sweetie?.

210
00:32:53.771 --> 00:32:55.636
No problem.

211
00:32:55.707 --> 00:32:59.700
Wait here one minute.
I finish here, you'll
walk me home.

212
00:33:04.682 --> 00:33:06.843
This is what I owe.

213
00:33:06.918 --> 00:33:09.045
It's my treat.
Forget it.

214
00:33:11.889 --> 00:33:13.618
All this?.

215
00:33:13.691 --> 00:33:15.454
I need to pay.

216
00:33:18.062 --> 00:33:21.327
Tell me.
You like?.

217
00:33:22.834 --> 00:33:27.567
I'm not sure
about color, but
very comfortable.

218
00:33:30.641 --> 00:33:32.268
I like this.

219
00:33:40.752 --> 00:33:42.982
You didn't tell
me your name.

220
00:33:44.856 --> 00:33:46.118
Galia.

221
00:33:46.190 --> 00:33:47.782
Galia.

222
00:33:47.859 --> 00:33:49.690
I know a Galia.

223
00:33:49.761 --> 00:33:51.956
There was a Galia
with me in the army.

224
00:33:52.030 --> 00:33:54.521
Nice girl, very
pretty. I hate her.

225
00:33:57.502 --> 00:33:59.060
Eleanor.

226
00:34:01.205 --> 00:34:03.639
Like the song.

227
00:34:03.708 --> 00:34:06.802
# Eleanor #

228
00:34:06.878 --> 00:34:11.110
# You're as pretty
As an angel #

229
00:34:15.920 --> 00:34:18.320
You know Zohar?.

230
00:34:18.389 --> 00:34:20.584
What is Zohar?.

231
00:34:20.658 --> 00:34:23.320
The best singer
in the world.

232
00:34:23.394 --> 00:34:27.228
You didn't hear
of the songbird?.

233
00:34:27.298 --> 00:34:29.789
You didn't
hear of the king?.

234
00:34:29.867 --> 00:34:32.597
The king is
not Elvis?.

235
00:34:32.670 --> 00:34:35.230
Here, king is Zohar.

236
00:34:35.306 --> 00:34:38.605
The flower in my garden,
Alone I shall walk.

237
00:34:38.676 --> 00:34:41.440
You don't know
these songs?.

238
00:34:44.015 --> 00:34:46.108
Sis, two years
in lsrael,

239
00:34:46.184 --> 00:34:50.177
and you don't hear
a little classic
lsraeli music?.

240
00:34:52.723 --> 00:34:54.714
You've got
a lot to learn.

241
00:34:56.994 --> 00:34:59.258
I'm

242
00:34:59.330 --> 00:35:00.695
I'm

243
00:35:00.765 --> 00:35:02.289
no

244
00:35:02.366 --> 00:35:03.731
no

245
00:35:03.801 --> 00:35:06.429
sucker.

246
00:35:06.504 --> 00:35:08.028
sucker.

247
00:35:08.106 --> 00:35:09.505
Exactly.

248
00:35:09.574 --> 00:35:12.737
When someone tells you
something you don't like,

249
00:35:12.810 --> 00:35:16.746
when you feel someone
tries to make you look
like an idiot,

250
00:35:16.814 --> 00:35:18.941
you just give them
that look and you say,

251
00:35:19.016 --> 00:35:21.507
Hey, I'm no sucker.

252
00:35:23.187 --> 00:35:27.851
Like this they
know you're not
some stupid airhead.

253
00:35:27.925 --> 00:35:30.189
You understand
me, Ahoti?.

254
00:35:32.763 --> 00:35:35.493
Hey, I'm no sucker.

255
00:35:35.566 --> 00:35:36.965
Nice!

256
00:35:37.034 --> 00:35:38.592
Yeah?.

257
00:35:38.669 --> 00:35:40.466
Yeah.

258
00:36:12.403 --> 00:36:16.362
See that guy over
there? The tall one
with the curly hair?

259
00:36:16.440 --> 00:36:19.466
Step out of the car,

260
00:36:19.544 --> 00:36:22.206
go to the side-entrance,

261
00:36:22.280 --> 00:36:24.373
you'll find our man.

262
00:36:24.448 --> 00:36:27.008
He'll let you
in quietly.

263
00:36:27.084 --> 00:36:32.613
Go inside,
and look for
them in the crowd.

